  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Bump rand from 0.9.2 to 0.9.4 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/pkgxdev/pkgx/pull/1264\n* Bump openssl from 0.10.72 to 0.10.78 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/pkgxdev/pkgx/pull/1265\n* Bump robinraju/release-downloader from 1.11 to 1.13 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/pkgxdev/pkgx/pull/1266\n* Bump openssl from 0.10.78 to 0.10.79 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/pkgxdev/pkgx/pull/1268\n* Bump openssl from 0.10.79 to 0.10.80 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/pkgxdev/pkgx/pull/1270\n* Bump actions/checkout from 6 to 7 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/pkgxdev/pkgx/pull/1273\n* restore the \"fat\" default docker image; publish a \"slim\" variant by @jhheider in https://github.com/pkgxdev/pkgx/pull/1275\n* Allow multi-version openssl/abseil alongside unicode by @jhheider in https://github.com/pkgxdev/pkgx/pull/1278\n* bump 2.11.0 // 0.9.0 by @jhheider in https://github.com/pkgxdev/pkgx/pull/1279\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/pkgxdev/pkgx/compare/v2.10.3...v2.11.0",
